# Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded base-2 logarithm log2(x) of BF16
#
# A normal x = 2^e m: log2(2^e) and log2(m) come from two tables of B32 values whose sum rounds correctly to BF16.
# Subnormals are tabulated directly. Round to nearest only: log2(+-0) = -inf, a negative x gives the quiet NaN,
# log2(+inf) = +inf, and a positive NaN comes back quiet.
#
# Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binaryb16/log2/log2_bf16.c.
# Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
# MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module Standard/System/Numerics/BF16

